{"content":[{"c":["GEMARIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Hilkiah’s son and emissary to Nebuchadnezzar from King Zedekiah. He carried Jeremiah’s letter to the exiles in Babylon (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.29.3","r":"Jer.29.3","rawR":"Jer.29.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.29.3","value":"Jer.29.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 29:3"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Son of Shaphan the scribe. In the temple chamber of Gemariah, Baruch read Jeremiah’s scroll (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.36.10-12,25","r":"Jer.36.10-12,25","rawR":"Jer.36.10-12,25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.36.10-12,25","value":"Jer.36.10-12,25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 36:10-12, 25"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Gemariah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jer 29:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.29.3","rawQueryValue":"Jer.29.3","sourceRefExact":"Jer.29.3"},{"anchorText":"Jer 36:10-12, 25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.36.10-12,25","rawQueryValue":"Jer.36.10-12,25","sourceRefExact":"Jer.36.10-12,25"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"a12cf3fff6da5add4e6191ae8ba046afd44db97b2d71157cc817af8c54cb921c","sourceItemName":"Gemariah","sourceItemOrder":85,"sourceMember":"Articles/G.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Gemariah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Gemariah","title":"Gemariah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}